Output src/generated/insert_sequence.mp4
Require nvim

Hide
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Type "nvim --clean src/generated/insert_sequence.text"
Enter
Show

Type ":"
Type "0"
Type "r"
Type "e"
Type "a"
Type "d"
Type " "
Type "!"
Type "s"
Type "e"
Type "q"
Type " "
Type "3"
Enter

Escape

Hide
Type ":w!"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2s